From: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
Subject: [PATCH] aic8800: port the driver to Linux 7.3

Convert the cfg80211 ops to wireless_dev, add radio_idx and
the ROC/mgmt-tx cookie ABI, update the ch-switch/station
notifications, timer and NAPI helpers, strncpy, wakelock and
the TDLS action union.

Signed-off-by: Paul Philippov <paul@themactep.com>
---
